      "id": "claim_0391a247f6e84f1fb3d5f869c427fb84",
      "statement": "The Harbor eval freezes five job sources: RemoteOK, Himalayas, Remotive, and Jobicy (JSON APIs mapped by hostname in HOSTS) plus Workable (HTML at jobs.workable.com, served via a separate workable_fixture path router). Any host outside these five, or any Workable path the fixture map does not recognise, raises RuntimeError, so adding a sixth source to agent.py would turn the eval red before it ships.",
