      "id": "claim_9c3139f9a7774d9292888c7c9e3c0257",
      "statement": "frozen_apis.py replaces requests.get with a host router and replaces every other requests entry point (post, put, patch, delete, head, options, request) and Session.request with a function that raises, so a call that escaped the frozen stub would fail in-process even on a networked host.",
